          ("notes" . "Downloads 11.6 MB (four IDX files) and converts them to one row per 28 x 28 grayscale image of a handwritten digit: the 60,000 training images, then the 10,000 test images, in file order, as torchvision's MNIST with train=True then train=False. Pixels are pixel1 to pixel784 in row-major order. License NOASSERTION: the authors state no terms; the files are fetched for use from the mirrors torchvision and TensorFlow Datasets use and never redistributed. yann.lecun.com no longer serves them.")
