          ("notes" . "Downloads 33.2 MB (flights.csv, Rdatasets' CSV of nycflights13 1.0.2) and converts it to the 336,776 flights that departed EWR, JFK and LGA in 2013, in R's row order. CRAN's .rda is bzip2-compressed, which base Racket cannot read, so Rdatasets is the source (code MIT, data unchanged). Its rownames column is dropped and empty fields are missing. Columns keep their R types: integers stay integers, doubles are reals; names normalized to kebab-case. The R POSIXct time_hour (America/New_York) is an ISO 8601 UTC string. The other four tables are bundled in datasets-r: nycflights13-airlines, nycflights13-airports, nycflights13-planes and nycflights13-weather.")
